DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260524T123000
UID:612c8f57418c8f78c448ed53@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:On this occasion we welcome special guest and friend of the LB
 C\, Marc Robinson. Marc has spent his career working as a nurse\, midwife\
 , and humanitarian in the UK\, and in conflicts\, disease outbreaks\, and 
 natural disasters around the world.
